    <item>
      <title>1.0.20</title>
      <pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 07:25:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>20</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.20</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
      <sparkle:informationalUpdate>
        <sparkle:belowVersion>17</sparkle:belowVersion>
      </sparkle:informationalUpdate>
      <link>https://github.com/surfine/WindowShade/releases/tag/v1.0.20</link>
      <description><![CDATA[设置里新增「功能」页：核心的卷帘、看一眼、带到每张桌面始终开启，刘海、窗口浏览、启动台、画中画等 8 个功能可以整块开关，关掉后菜单、快捷键和后台工作一起停；新装只默认打开常用的几项，升级用户保持原样。另修好 macOS 26 双击缩放、收起后闪一下桌面、刘海尺寸与角落停车等问题。需要 macOS 15 或更新版本。]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/surfine/WindowShade/releases/download/v1.0.20/WindowShade-v1.0.20.zip" length="22192888" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="NMcF7iNwZQppUZjILUp5L16hHtwEHWjbM6rhnHpu8Bp8piQQaVBAyRQOPnKIPU/XJksUad6taAODtoQ0EgX6Bw=="></enclosure>
    </item>
